---
---

<section id="pricing" class="py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl space-y-16">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-indigo-500/30 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-500/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 shadow-sm">
        🎉 Launch Offer: Up to 70% Off First Project
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl">
        Honest Pricing & <span class="gradient-text">Freelance Deals</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed font-medium">
        Simple, transparent rates with zero risk. Here is how my freelance launch offer works:
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Human Honest Explanation Box -->
    <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 border-2 border-indigo-500/40 relative shadow-xl max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-200 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          <span class="text-2xl">👋</span>
          <span>A Quick Note on How This Launch Deal Works</span>
        </div>
        
        <p>
          I'm officially starting out as an independent freelancer, and to build up my roster of happy client case studies, I'm offering <strong class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-bold">up to 70% off on your first service or project</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
          Now, you could technically "cheat the system" by requesting a project at 70% off once and never coming back... and that's totally okay! But I'm confident that after seeing the care, speed, and technical quality I put into our work, you'll be happy to build a lasting professional relationship together. For any second project onwards, we'll simply charge the standard rate or agree on a fair custom price per discussion.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">
            <span>🛡️ 100% Refund Guarantee:</span> If anything doesn't work out as expected, I will refund the full amount with no questions asked.
          </div>
          <a href="#contact" class="font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 underline hover:text-indigo-700">
            Tell me about your project ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Retainer Cards Grid (With 70% Off Badges) -->
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
      
      <!-- Option 1 -->
      <div class="glass-card spotlight-card rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Ad Campaigns</span>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/40 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5">70% Off First Job</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Google & Meta Paid Ads</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">Full campaign setup, audience targeting, pixel tracking, and ad creative optimization.</p>
          
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              <span class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-bold">✓</span> Targeted Search & Display Ad Setup
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              <span class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-bold">✓</span> Meta Audience & Pixel Tracking
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              <span class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-bold">✓</span> Monthly ROAS & Creative Testing
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a href="#contact" class="w-full text-center rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-gray-800/80 px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:bg-indigo-600 hover:text-white transition-all">
          Get 70% Off First Run ⚡
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Option 2 (Custom Request Highlight) -->
      <div class="glass-card spotlight-card rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between border-2 border-indigo-500/60 relative shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-600/10">
        <span class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-cyan-500 px-4 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider shadow-md">
          Request Anything Custom
        </span>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Custom Scope</span>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-cyan-100 dark:bg-cyan-900/40 text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5">70% Off First Job</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Whatever You Need Built</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">Need a custom AI tool, Shopify catalog fix, GA4 audit, or fast site? Just let me know.</p>
          
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-200">
              <span class="text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span> E-Commerce & Marketplace Catalog Sync
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-200">
              <span class="text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span> AI Automation Scripts & Local LLMs
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-200">
              <span class="text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span> Fast Astro / Next.js Web App Builds
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a href="#contact" class="w-full text-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-cyan-500 px-4 py-3.5 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-lg hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
          Request Anything Custom 🚀
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Option 3 -->
      <div class="glass-card spotlight-card rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider">AI & Web Ops</span>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5">70% Off First Job</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">AI Scripts & Web Infrastructure</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">Automate manual spreadsheet tasks, deploy local AI, or build high-performing web apps.</p>
          
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> Custom Python Data & Workflow Automation
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> GA4 Custom Events & IndexNow Setup
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-gray-300">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> 100/100 Lighthouse Web Performance
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a href="#contact" class="w-full text-center rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-gray-800/80 px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 hover:text-white transition-all">
          Get 70% Off First Project ↗
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
